        "author_id": "U0A6088AMM3",
        "author_name": "Avinash Kumar 2",
        "author_subname": "Avinash Kumar 2",
        "author_link": "https://getolake.slack.com/team/U0A6088AMM3",
        "author_icon": "https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2025-12-30/10205672920838_9348da909b29f70dd9f5_48.png",
        "text": "Hi team,\nWe're running a Full Refresh + CDC sync from MySQL at 1-minute frequency, using Lakekeeper (REST catalog) with GCS storage via HMAC keys, warehouse flavor set to `s3-compat`.\nFull Refresh completed successfully, and the first few CDC syncs ran fine too — but some recent CDC jobs have started failing.\nAttached the logs for reference.\nThanks!",
